var e={tool:`caddy`,download:`https://caddyserver.com/docs/install`,guide:`https://caddyserver.com/docs/api`,setup:{windows:`Use an official Caddy binary or documented Windows package; make caddy available to the host.`,darwin:`Use the documented macOS binary or package. Homebrew packages are community-maintained.`,linux:`Use the official distribution package. Some packages start a system service during installation.`},afterSetup:`Configure and start your proxy separately. The example reads upstream observations from an existing loopback admin API, not the full configuration.`,notes:[`Never publish the Caddy admin port. This guide does not edit configuration or own a service.`,`Upstream addresses can be private. Verify the chosen host and port before sending.`],commands:[{label:`Read the native build version`,text:`caddy version`}],endpoint:{url:`http://127.0.0.1:2019/reverse_proxy/upstreams`,notice:`Example loopback admin API, not full /config/. Keep this port private; the draft remains unsent.`}};export{e as default};